guide_notes = "The fungus cave's residents, spore ticks near the entrance up through the Fungal Heart itself — killing it counts too and pays a boss bonus on top. Spore swarms die in a hit or two but poison on burst — keep a cure or just outrange them."
location_hint = "Fungus Cave"
